[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-WEB-007
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Evidence charts
STATEMENT: >>>
Under "Evidence" the report page shall draw, from the findings' `chart_data`: the oscillation frequency spectrum
with its peak marked; IMU acceleration per sensor (at most three) or the autopilot's vibration metric against its
warning and critical limits; battery voltage (V) and current (A); GPS satellites and HDOP with a line at HDOP 2;
EKF innovation test ratios (at most six) with a line at 1.0; motor RPM (at most eight motors). Time axes shall be
log-relative `m:ss`. A value that is missing or not a finite number shall be a gap, never zero. Each chart shall
mark the time window of every finding of its category in that finding's severity colour and the armed windows in
grey, and "Show on chart" on a finding shall scroll to its chart and outline it. A chart that cannot be drawn shall
be replaced by "Chart unavailable" without affecting the rest of the page; when no chart can be built the section
is absent.
<<<
