VERIFICATION_NOTE: >>>
The chart data rules are tested at LLR level (LLR-WEB-046 to LLR-WEB-053). No test renders `ChartsSection.tsx`,
`TimeSeriesChart.tsx` or `SpectrumChart.tsx`; drawing, windows and the fallback are checked by reading them.
<<<
