[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-WEB-008
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Flight path map and 3D view
STATEMENT: >>>
When the report has a `gps_path` the report page shall draw it on a map (tiles from `NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_URL`,
OpenStreetMap when unset) with a launch marker, an end marker and direction arrows, and on request as a 3D view
with height drawn three times larger. At most 1,000 points are drawn. The user may colour the path by wind speed
or by GPS HDOP when the report carries those series; points with no reading are grey. Selecting a finding that has
a time window shall highlight that stretch of the path on the map when the report carries `gps_path_t_s`. The
altitude range of the path and the total distance shall be shown in the chosen units. Without a path the section
shall read "No GPS positions in this log, so there is no path to draw.".
<<<
