[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-WEB-010
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Marking changes as applied
STATEMENT: >>>
On the parameter sheet the user shall be able to tick entries, give an airframe label (filled in when this browser
uploaded the log with one) and press "Mark as applied". The page shall then send `POST
/airframe/<label>/changes` with the report id, `applied_by: "user"` and for each ticked entry its name, the
report's current value and the report's suggested value, unconverted. On success it shall confirm the count and
link to the airframe page. On 401 or 403 it shall show the error and a link to the airframe page to enter the
token; on any other failure the API's text or "Could not record the changes (<status>).".
<<<
