[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-WEB-013
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Exports and printing
STATEMENT: >>>
The report page shall offer the report as PDF (`GET /export/pdf/<id>`) and JSON (`GET /export/json/<id>`) and,
when the report has a GPS path, the path as GPX (`GET /export/gpx/<id>`) and KML (`GET /export/kml/<id>`). Each is
fetched with a 60 s limit and saved under a name built from the log's file name (`<name>_flightmd.pdf`,
`<name>_flightmd.json`, `<name>.gpx`, `<name>.kml`). When the PDF call answers 501 the page shall open the
browser's print dialog and say why. Any other failure shall show the API's text or "Download failed (<status>).".
The printed page shall be the report in the light theme without navigation, buttons, search or export bar, with
every finding opened and with the page address and print time at the top.
<<<
