[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-WEB-018
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Maintenance log, checklist and flight record
STATEMENT: >>>
The airframe page shall show whether maintenance is due, the flight hours since the last maintenance and the
service interval; the maintenance log, newest first; a form to add an entry (date, today by default in the user's
time zone; work done, required; notes) sent as `POST /airframe/<label>/maintenance`; the service interval in
