[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-WEB-019
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Alert rules and webhook
STATEMENT: >>>
The airframe page shall let the token holder edit the airframe's alert rules (metric from a fixed list of twelve,
below or above, threshold, description) and its webhook address, saved together by `PUT
/airframe/<label>/config` as `alert_rules` and `webhook_url` (null when empty). A new rule starts as overall score
below 70. A threshold that is empty or not a number shall stop the save with a message naming the metric; a
webhook address that does not start with `https://` shall stop the save with "The webhook URL must start with
https://". Thresholds are entered and sent in the report's own units whatever the unit preference. A failed save
shall show the API's text or "Could not save the alert rules.".
<<<
