[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-WEB-020
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Applied changes and their result
STATEMENT: >>>
The airframe page shall list each record of applied parameter changes: its verification status (pending,
improved, unchanged, worse, mixed) as an icon and a word; who marked it and when; each parameter with its old and
new value; the note; and, once a later flight exists, the findings resolved, the findings new and the change in
overall score, module scores and key metrics, with links to the report the change came from, the next flight and
the comparison of the two. A pending record shall say to fly again with the same label.
<<<
